{"id":287,"gn":"Pokémon Flâneur","ft":["Il passe le plus clair de son temps affalé. Rien qu’à le voir, on a envie de bâiller.","Rien qu’à voir un Parecool, on n’a plus envie de bouger et on s’endort.","Il dort 20 heures par jour et ne fait rien d’autre, si ce n’est manger trois ou quatre feuilles dans la journée.","Parecool se prélasse plus de vingt heures par jour. Il bouge tellement peu qu’il n’a presque pas besoin de manger. Le repas quotidien de ce Pokémon n’est constitué que de trois feuilles.","Le cœur de Parecool ne bat qu’une fois par minute. Quoi qu’il arrive, il se contente de s’avachir, immobile. Il est très rare de voir ce Pokémon se déplacer."],"fv":{"17":0,"18":0,"23":1,"24":2,"25":3,"26":4},"gr":4,"cr":255,"hc":15,"bh":70,"eg":["Terrestre"],"gw":"slow","gm":{"svdisk":[0,59],"sv":[0,78,2,59],"oras":[0,37],"b2w2":[0,276],"e":[0,36],"rs":[0,36]},"f":{"287":{"n":"Parecool","t":["normal"],"s":[60,60,60,35,35,30],"h":0.8,"w":24,"a":[[54,0]],"av":["svdisk","sv","oras","b2w2","e","rs"],"ls":[{"l":[[10,1],[281,1],[227,6],[303,9],[29,14],[133,17],[343,22],[675,25],[68,30],[175,33],[583,38]],"m":[7,8,9,34,36,53,58,59,76,85,87,118,126,133,156,157,164,168,174,182,189,196,203,206,214,227,232,240,241,247,263,264,270,280,317,332,339,341,374,398,402,404,421,428,441,583,675,851,886],"e":[34,163,173,174,306,321,359,400,495]},{"l":[[10,1],[281,1],[227,6],[303,9],[185,14],[133,17],[343,22],[498,25],[68,30],[175,33],[583,38]],"m":[15,53,58,59,70,76,85,87,92,104,126,156,157,164,182,207,213,214,216,218,237,240,241,247,249,263,280,290,317,332,339,374,421,468,496,510,514,590,612],"e":[34,163,173,174,214,228,306,321,359,400,495],"t":[7,8,9,173,196,264,343,351,352,441,495]},{"l":[[10,1],[281,1],[227,7],[303,13],[185,19],[133,25],[343,31],[498,37],[68,43],[175,49]],"m":[15,53,58,59,70,76,85,87,92,104,126,156,157,164,182,207,213,216,218,237,240,241,247,249,263,280,317,332,339,374,421,468,496,510,514,526],"e":[34,163,173,174,214,228,306,321,359,400,495],"t":[7,8,9,173,196,214,343,4